{"version":1,"content":"<p>Chantel姚焯菲早前順利完成首個香港個唱，她當時曾透露年底和大家在澳門見面。</p><p>今天（20日） Chantel正式宣布將於12月26日「拆禮物日」，在澳門舉行《姚焯菲 Chantel 想飛 Live Concert 2026澳門站》，票價分別為$1080（VIP）和$680兩種。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.201593+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:14:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T18:57:48.205478+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684322+00:00","content_hash":"ecbae037b3f9ada26e467b47f1cb05a1596ede6a3fa5520d1824679d085ddf00","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}